  m_text: "Artists create visual designs, illustrations, logos, posters, and digital
    graphics using traditional and computer-based tools. They help communicate ideas
    through creative artwork used in games, websites, advertisements, and other media.\n\nMain
    Responsibilities\n\u2022 Create digital and traditional artwork.\n\u2022 Design
    posters, logos, and illustrations.\n\u2022 Use graphic design software to produce
    visual content.\n\nSkills Needed\n\u2022 Creativity and imagination.\n\u2022
    Drawing and design skills.\n\u2022 Basic knowledge of digital art tools.\n"
