    infoImage: {fileID: 7726829825231612145, guid: f49bbbb9ea2f24fce89d57bf6fef8ac7, type: 3}
    description: "Artists create visual designs, illustrations, logos, posters, and
      digital graphics using traditional and computer-based tools. They help communicate
      ideas through creative artwork used in games, websites, advertisements, and
      other media.\n\nMain Responsibilities\n\u2022 Create digital and traditional
      artwork.\n\u2022 Design posters, logos, and illustrations.\n\u2022 Use graphic
      design software to produce visual content.\n\nSkills Needed\n\u2022 Creativity
      and imagination.\n\u2022 Drawing and design skills.\n\u2022 Basic knowledge
      of digital art tools."
    introMessage: Let's find the Artist career!
    wrongMessage: Oops! That's not the Artist. Try again!
    correctMessage: You got it! That's the Artist!
