    infoImage: {fileID: -1506335293035484331, guid: d4b0ba67c906d4176b7c1f9cc9324c6a, type: 3}
    description: "A Telecommunications Specialist helps people communicate through
      phone, internet, and other communication systems. They may install and maintain
      networks, provide technical support, or assist customers in call or contact
      centers. Their work ensures that communication services are fast, secure, and
      reliable.\n\nMain Responsibilities\n\u2022 Install and maintain communication
      systems and networks.\n\u2022 Provide technical support for phone and internet
      services.\n\u2022 Ensure communication systems are secure and reliable.\n\nSkills
      Needed\n\u2022 Basic networking and communication technology.\n\u2022 Troubleshooting
      and technical support skills.\n\u2022 Knowledge of internet and telephone systems."
    introMessage: Let's find the Telecommunications career!
    wrongMessage: Oops! That's not Telecommunications. Try again!
    correctMessage: You got it! That's Telecommunications!
  - careerName: Technician
    mascotObject: {fileID: 371353603}
    slotObject: {fileID: 72269662}
    infoImage: {fileID: -434815488516523663, guid: 831f093a105094a6791d61e198634273, type: 3}
    description: "Computer Technicians install, repair, maintain, and troubleshoot
      computer hardware and software. They make sure computers and other devices
      work properly and solve technical problems.\n\nMain Responsibilities\n\u2022
      Assemble and repair computer hardware.\n\u2022 Install operating systems and
      software.\n\u2022 Troubleshoot hardware and software issues.\n\nSkills Needed\n\u2022
      Hardware assembly.\n\u2022 Problem-solving.\n\u2022 Knowledge of computer components."
    introMessage: Let's find the Technician career!
    wrongMessage: Oops! That's not the Technician. Try again!
    correctMessage: You got it! That's the Technician!
  - careerName: Information Technology
    mascotObject: {fileID: 1699585106}
    slotObject: {fileID: 1631512171}
    infoImage: {fileID: -5599150887611024536, guid: fe91b08f57dcb4eb4846537718a5c025, type: 3}
    description: "IT Professionals develop, manage, and support computer systems,
      software, websites, mobile applications, and networks. They help organizations
      use technology efficiently and securely.\n\nMain Responsibilities\n\u2022 Develop
      software and websites.\n\u2022 Manage computer systems and networks.\n\u2022
      Maintain and secure IT infrastructure.\n\nSkills Needed\n\u2022 Programming
      and web development.\n\u2022 Networking and cybersecurity basics.\n\u2022 Analytical
      and technical problem-solving."
    introMessage: Let's find the IT career!
    wrongMessage: Oops! That's not IT. Try again!
    correctMessage: You got it! That's IT!
  resultSequence: 0100000000000000030000000000000002000000010000000200000003000000
